OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the unlikely doubles duo
OL,4,Aproving age is just a number
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey may be 66 years apart in age, but
OL,7,Fon the tennis court David McCandless
OL,8,Fand his doubles partner Liam have
OL,9,Fdeveloped a partnership that has proved
OL,10,Fa winning combination.
OL,12,FThe 80-year-old and his 14-year-old
OL,13,Fcounterpart teamed up two years ago and
OL,14,Fhave not looked back since.
OL,16,FSince then, the unlikely pairing have
OL,17,Fwon more than half of their North West
OL,18,Fof Ireland league games - after ironing
OL,19,Fout a few kinks.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
